      </Text>
      <Text fill="#898989" layoutX="233.0" layoutY="135.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="in" AnchorPane.bottomAnchor="450.0" AnchorPane.leftAnchor="240.0">
